{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act25side_level_act25side_03_end",
  "groupId": "act25side",
  "stageId": "act25side_03",
  "title": "台前幕後",
  "storyCode": "CW-3",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act25side/level_act25side_03_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "b4f43e6c0102f01036122986594203a3fe36a207f822fe61deb9314247b82c4e",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "29_g9_headquarter"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑克遜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_897_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“科技是哥倫比亞的未來”並不是一句漂亮話或者廣告語，雅拉主任，我今天像是一個第一次上科學課的孩子，真是大開眼界。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑克遜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_897_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可惜時間太短，還有好多感興趣的項目沒來得及聽你們講解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_893_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萊茵生命隨時歡迎您的再次到來，傑克遜先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑克遜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_897_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多謝你，雅拉主任。今天太過興師動眾，希望沒有給你帶來不便。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_893_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您太客氣了，我今天只是您的導遊而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑克遜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_897_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能讓曾經紅極一時的瑪麗安娜·布萊克女士充當導遊，是我特里蒙之行的又一大收穫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑克遜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_897_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不瞞您說，我也是您的粉絲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑克遜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_897_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我收藏了您出道作品的簽名海報，並把它貼在了我辦公室的牆壁上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_893_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑克遜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_897_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "實不相瞞，那正是我太太送我的就職禮物，哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑克遜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_897_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "帕瓦爾，有關萊茵生命在特區新建研發基地的申請，或許可以關照一下特區政府的推進。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "副總統秘書",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "記下來了，先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑克遜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_897_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼，今天的行程就到這裡了，雅拉女士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_893_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也祝您在特里蒙接下來的旅程順利。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑克遜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_897_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑克遜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_897_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很好的祝福。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑克遜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_897_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這一天已經過去，希望接下來也都是晴天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "記者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快拍、快拍......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "記者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "副總統先生，請問您如何評價這次的萊茵之旅？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊茵職員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_529_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "各位不要著急，副總統先生特意留出了十分鐘的時間接受採訪，請有序發言。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "記者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "avg_249_mlyss_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你沒有聽錯，我正在鼓掌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "avg_249_mlyss_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“副總統與萊茵生命人力資源科主任相談甚歡”“副總統訪問助推萊茵生命的科技巨頭之路”，我都能猜到這幫記者會配什麼標題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "avg_249_mlyss_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "活動已經結束，現場沒有異常情況，副總統將在十分鐘後離開萊茵生命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "avg_249_mlyss_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......博士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_cherunder_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，已經收到了你傳過來的路線圖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也就是說，還有一條可供潛入的秘密路線，直通地下結構，但不在繆爾賽思給你的圖紙上？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "交給我好了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你和迷迭香在上面跟動力甲打得熱火朝天，我在連接層蹲守了半天，別說可疑的人了，壓根就沒有人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "塞雷婭會來找我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我也得先前往地下結構，不是說副總統還有幾分鐘就要離開了嗎，得盡快排除風險才行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（壓低聲音）就這樣，伊芙利特開始行動，博士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特工A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我回來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特工B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "上面怎麼樣了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特工A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聽不太清楚，我沒上到地面，但好像沒什麼特別的動靜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特工A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我估計，沒得手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特工B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我們？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特工A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "按照上校的命令，開啟了訊號干擾，不支援任何其他單位......應該沒有人查到這裡來，斐爾迪南提供的潛入路徑很隱蔽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特工A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "執行作戰計劃吧。對一下錶......嗯，也差不多到時間了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特工A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "炸藥怎麼樣了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特工B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你剛剛去查探情況的時候已經佈置好了......兩管改造過的塑性炸藥，足夠破壞這層防洩漏裝置。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特工B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過斐爾迪南也真夠狠的，這可是他們能量科專用的液化源石氣管道，他不是還說要回萊茵生命嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特工A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "按上校的說法，他和咱們現在是拴在一條線上的蟲子，沒得選擇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特工B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過我不明白現在搞這麼一場爆破的意義在哪裡......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特工B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "副總統這個時間點應該已經離開萊茵生命了，大樓地下結構的液化源石氣管道爆炸，能傷得到他嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特工A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "上校自有他的安排，執行命令就好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特工A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特工B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一個......孩子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士的情報真準，還真有人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，你們兩個，雖然不知道你們躲在這裡想幹什麼，但是可以投降了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "29_g11_monitoringroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所有作戰單位全部失去聯絡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是的，都是通訊突然中斷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "從現場的情況來看，副總統及隨行人員、記者......沒有人有特別的反應，看來我們派出的人在行動之前就已經被按下了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且，我們在萊茵內部的行動也出現了混亂，據說受到了一批動力甲的干擾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能夠監視各個路口的攝影機訊號也在陸續被掐斷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "上校，我們正在失去對現場的掌控。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可能我們佈置得天衣無縫的計劃，在梅蘭德基金會構建的情報網裡，根本就是漏洞百出。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這起刺殺計劃本來就很倉促，他們做出了應對也很正常。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "上校，那......我們要撤離嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然對方的反應這麼快，遲早會查到這裡來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不急......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我記得副總統先生說過，他希望“和優秀的科研人員好好交流”，我本來也打算滿足他這個願望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "C1、C2那邊有什麼反應？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "訊號穩定，還在指定位置。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雷克，控制台右上角的那個遙控裝置，啟動它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "布萊克所說的遙控裝置，只是一枚看起來相當普通的機械按鈕，還採用了老式的安全閥鎖定裝置。\n士兵輸入密碼，透明的安全閥應聲彈開，紅色的按鈕暴露在空氣中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "上校，這是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "工程炸藥的遙控裝置，用來炸毀液化源石氣管道的阻斷結構。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看螢幕，對，根據斐爾迪南提供的入侵路線，在萊茵生命大樓的西側，有幾條專供能量科的液化源石氣管道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萊茵生命工程科的工作做得很細緻......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "除了防護裝置，還在一定範圍內增設了地下阻斷結構，應用的特殊材料能夠防止洩露的液化源石氣引發連環爆炸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原本的計劃，是透過爆破，造成液化源石氣洩露，引發騷亂，為地面上的人創造接近傑克遜的機會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但巧合的是，傑克遜車隊預定的回程路線，正好和液化源石氣管道有一處交會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_cherunder_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特工A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是......萊茵生命的員工？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特工A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看著倒是一副不好惹的樣子......聽說防衛科裡有不少脾氣很衝的傢伙，但也不應該雇傭這麼小的孩子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說了讓你們投降，怎麼話那麼多？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我會盡量控制一下，不把你們兩個烤成焦炭，畢竟說不定博士和塞雷婭想要親自審審你們這些壞人，讓你們當證人什麼的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特工B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，你手裡拿的是......噴火器？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特工B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這周圍可都是液化源石氣管道，小心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原來你們是想......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "火紅的薩弗拉孩子在一秒鐘之內完成了判斷，她扣上火焰放射器的安全鎖，抬手用力砸向左邊的人。\n下一秒，她全力向右邊衝出，一拳揮中右邊人的臉頰。\n像是火焰即明即滅，伊芙利特已經重新站穩，並俐落地拍了拍手掌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特工A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咕......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特工B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的鼻樑大概斷了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特工B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "孩子，你快跑吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼聲音？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "糟糕，他還是按下了計時器......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只有不到一分鐘了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "29_g11_monitoringroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那C1、C2還回得來嗎......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我會親自向長官們申請，為他們，以及今天殉職的所有戰友，發放軍功章。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "上校，那可是，一整個副總統車隊——五輛車，十多個隨行人員，萬一附近還有萊茵職員和記者、行人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "服從命令，雷克。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "由我來親自按下遙控裝置，這是我站在這裡的任務......而你的任務，是在C1、C2的爆破訊號傳來的時候，第一時間向我匯報。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "未來我可能會站在軍事法庭上，接受程序或道德的審判，我不會為自己辯解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以此時此刻，我不想浪費口舌向我的士兵解釋什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "訊號來了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "副總統的車隊也即將行駛到萊茵生命西側的指定區域。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "上校？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "布萊克的手放在了那枚冰冷的機械按鈕上，涼意瞬間爬上他的手指，他停頓了兩秒。\n士兵瞥了一眼自己的長官，墨鏡後他的眉毛皺得很緊。\n士兵突然反應過來，其實他比自己還緊張......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（低聲）*哥倫比亞粗口*！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "布萊克按下了按鈕。\n沒有聲音，只有部分監視螢幕上出現了爆炸的畫面。\n在那些微縮的視界裡，頃刻間淪陷的街道像是保麗龍，火光只是泛白的圖像。所有的畫面突然消失，大概是攝影機被擊飛的磚石摧毀了。\n沒有聲音，但布萊克和士兵似乎都聽見了爆炸聲，震耳欲聾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這個方向，應該快到地面了才對，但這些石板把路全封住了，看不見......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，你們倆沒事吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "糟糕，是連環爆炸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "伊芙利特？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "那個無比熟悉的聲音穿透爆炸的餘波和土石墜落的窸窣動靜，鑽進了伊芙利特的耳朵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "塞雷婭？我在這裡！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聽到了......堅持住！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "鎖定你的位置了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "伊芙利特清楚地聽出了塞雷婭的聲音在輕微顫抖，黑暗中，有什麼東西觸碰到了她的手指......鈣質結晶？那是塞雷婭的源石技藝。\n鈣質結晶像是穩定的水流，沿著土石的縫隙迅速連成一片，再猛然撐開，周圍的結構因為擠壓而發出令人牙酸的異響——\n塞雷婭強行在坍塌的地下結構中開出了一條狹窄的甬道。\n一隻手伸了下來，伊芙利特跳起握住，一股強大的力量將自己拽向地面，鈣質甬道在身後轟然碎裂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "29_g8_alley_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我沒事，只是碰了點灰而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的臉......你剛才哭過了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......我才沒有哭！只是有點著急了而已！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "塞雷婭，你的手上也都是灰，越擦我臉上越髒了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......啊，抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這兩個人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就是他們兩個在地下結構放炸藥，炸了液化源石氣的管道，所以我把他們帶了出來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是塞雷婭，我沒能阻止爆炸......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你已經做得很好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......真的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "伊芙利特，你在看什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "赫默？你怎麼來了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......赫默。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_1031_slent2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼，你們會在這裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "29_g7_mainstreet_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_893_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "副總統先生，帕瓦爾秘書，現在可以上車了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑克遜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_897_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "剛剛那個車隊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_893_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請放心，只是炸毀了一些機甲而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑克遜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_897_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_893_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這輛私家車經過了工程科的改裝，不起眼，但可以放心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_893_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "麻煩帕瓦爾秘書充當一下司機，走萊茵生命大樓東側的特別通道離開，我們已經規劃好了新的路線。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_893_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您的其他隨行人員，則會在事情結束後分批返回。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑克遜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_897_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "剛剛的爆炸，也在你們的預料之中？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_893_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "並沒有。這種規模的爆炸，如果事先得到了情報，我們肯定會予以排除。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_893_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是在副總統先生回到住所之前，萊茵生命和梅蘭德基金會的工作都還沒有結束罷了......對方不止一項計劃，我們自然也不止一套預案。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑克遜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_897_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑克遜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_897_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對了，我不希望明天的新聞上出現“第二個特萊頓工廠”之類的字眼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_893_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "記者那邊，我們已經有了安排，請您放心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_893_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再一次祝您在特里蒙接下來的旅程順利。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑克遜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_897_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
